   "options": "Something is broken\nSomething looks wrong\nI need training\nWe need it to work differently\nNice to have\nNew user or access\nSomething with Intacct",
   "default": "Something is broken",
   "reqd": 1,
   "in_list_view": 1,
   "description": "Broken means it errors or will not go. Looks wrong means it worked but the numbers or the data are not right - a different job, and usually a more urgent one. Nice to have is an idea with nothing waiting on it, and saying so is what keeps the queue honest."
  },
  {
   "fieldname": "urgency",
